+- `bin/memo.js` — CLI entry (`init | note | hook | brief`).
+- `src/` — implementation (paths, git, init, note, hook, brief, redact).
+- `templates/post-commit` — Git hook template installed by `memo init`.
+- `test/` — `node:test` suites; run `npm test`.
